{
  "uid": "eurotransit-kafka",
  "title": "EuroTransit — Kafka & CDC (money-path pipeline)",
  "tags": ["eurotransit", "kafka", "lag", "cdc", "dlt"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "type": "datasource",
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Data source",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "type": "query",
        "name": "consumergroup",
        "label": "Consumer group",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "query": "label_values(kafka_consumergroup_lag, consumergroup)",
        "definition": "label_values(kafka_consumergroup_lag, consumergroup)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "options": [],
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Signal roles (Fase 4)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Sources: Strimzi **kafka-exporter** (`kafka_consumergroup_lag`, DLT offsets — enabled on the Kafka CR, scraped by `platform/strimzi/monitoring.yaml`) and **Connect JMX** (`kafka_connect_*`, `debezium_metrics_*` — `platform/debezium/monitoring.yaml`). Roles: **consumer lag = diagnostic only** (self-drains; never paged). **DLT depth and CDC state PAGE** (`DeadLetterTopicNotEmpty`, `CDCConnectorNotRunning`, slot alerts) — they do not self-heal. The user-visible symptom is the saga-completion SLI on the RED dashboard. Aggregate by group/topic, never by partition (cardinality)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumer lag (records) by group — kafka-exporter",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (consumergroup) (kafka_consumergroup_lag{consumergroup=~\"$consumergroup\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{consumergroup}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumer lag (records) by topic — kafka-exporter",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (topic) (kafka_consumergroup_lag)",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "DLT depth (messages) — PAGE when > 0: failed orders needing a human",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "min": 0 }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "eurotransit_dlt:depth:sum",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CDC connector / task state (1 = current status) — PAGE when not running",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "min": 0, "max": 1 }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max by (connector, status) (kafka_connect_connector_status)",
          "legendFormat": "{{connector}}: {{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Debezium — milliseconds behind source (streaming lag, self-heals)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "min": 0 }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max by (server) (debezium_metrics_millisecondsbehindsource{context=\"streaming\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{server}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Replication slot retained WAL (bytes) — slot invalidated at 512Mi",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 21 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "min": 0 }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max by (slot_name) (cnpg_pg_replication_slots_pg_wal_lsn_diff{slot_name=~\".+_outbox\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{slot_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumer lag (records) — Micrometer binder (alt source, in-app view)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 29 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max by (job, topic) (kafka_consumer_fetch_manager_records_lag)",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} / {{topic}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
